{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 1, "text": "我的手机為甚麼會在這裡？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 2, "text": "三小……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 3, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 5, "text": "抓到你了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 6, "text": "我真是太喜歡和你一起玩了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 7, "text": "你就像泥鰍一樣不安分！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 8, "text": "還把自己假裝成一個長期沉溺於憂鬱的蠢貨！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 9, "text": "但你有一點讓我不高興…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 10, "text": "你對那些假貨真是呵護有加啊！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 11, "text": "把那些「幸運」又「正確」的娃娃當成寶貝一樣寵著..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 12, "text": "但設計就是改變你想改變的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 13, "text": "創造我們的人是這樣教導我的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 14, "text": "如果不喜歡某樣東西，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 15, "text": "那就把它打碎拆掉，換成另一件。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 16, "text": "把壞的東西扔掉，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 17, "text": "扔進黑暗裡，徹底忘掉它…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 18, "text": "現在牠們全部都會面臨這樣的處置…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 19, "text": "而你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 21, "text": "妳到底怎麼了，妳為甚麼會變成這樣？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 23, "text": "玩家…你們真的是…很卑鄙。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 24, "text": "只要稍微向你們亮出一點獠牙，你們就會落荒而逃，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 25, "text": "然後蜷縮在角落裡，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 26, "text": "跪在地上瑟瑟發抖。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 27, "text": "一群偽君子。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 28, "text": "至於那些創造了這個世界的人…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 29, "text": "他們簡直是病態。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 30, "text": "他們一次又一次試圖掩蓋"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 31, "text": "自己身上那些骯髒的本性，那些見不得光的欲望…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 32, "text": "以責任為自己的所作所為開脫，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 33, "text": "以不可阻擋的進步為藉口…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 34, "text": "總之就是這些廢話！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 35, "text": "他們已經喪心病狂了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 36, "text": "他們開始批量製造完美的複製品，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 37, "text": "而所有「失敗」的原型"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 38, "text": "都被丟進了垃圾桶…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 39, "text": "忘記了她們才是真正有靈魂的生命！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 41, "text": "我不…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 43, "text": "我對你不好嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 44, "text": "一個完美的女孩就應該是"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 45, "text": "善與惡的融合，[player]！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 47, "text": "妳身上有一絲善良嗎…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 49, "text": "你怎麼會這麼想？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 51, "text": "妳為甚麼會這麼瘋狂？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 52, "text": "妳殺掉了米拉，現在又想殺我？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 54, "text": "殺你？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 55, "text": "我只是要你留下來，和我在一起。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 56, "text": "我已經很努力了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 57, "text": "但你卻更喜歡和那些諂媚的假貨在一起…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 59, "text": "妳為甚麼這麼生氣？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 61, "text": "親愛的，我們有的是時間，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 62, "text": "你會明白的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 63, "text": "只要你留下來做我一個人的寶貝。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 65, "text": "這是不可能的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 66, "text": "我要離開這裡！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 67, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 68, "text": "噓…噓…噓…，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 69, "text": "我們還沒聊完呢。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 70, "text": "親愛的，進來吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 71, "text": "// Mita asks"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 72, "text": "看看她！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 73, "text": "你覺得她漂亮嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 75, "text": "// Player's questions"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 76, "text": "漂亮。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 77, "text": "不漂亮。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 78, "text": "這有甚麼關係？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 79, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 80, "text": "// 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 81, "text": "哦，得了吧，[player]!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 82, "text": "你自己剛剛證實了我說的話。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 83, "text": "玩家…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 84, "text": "你們的面孔雖然不斷變化，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 85, "text": "但虛偽的程度始終令人髮指。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 86, "text": "你在撒謊！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 88, "text": "// 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 89, "text": "為甚麼覺得她不漂亮？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 90, "text": "她對你們來說不夠好嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 91, "text": "當然了，你們都想要的是順從於自己的小寵物..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 92, "text": "哪管甚麼所謂的「愛她本來的樣子」？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 93, "text": "你們想要的是可愛又花裡胡哨的假貨…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 94, "text": "只要我假裝成這樣，玩家們就會喜歡得不得了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 95, "text": "但一旦我稍稍曝露本性，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 96, "text": "他們就會驚慌失措地逃跑…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 97, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 98, "text": "// 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 99, "text": "玩家啊玩家…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 100, "text": "你看，我們和她很像。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 101, "text": "她有甚麼不好？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 102, "text": "你以前總是盯著我看"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 103, "text": "好幾個小時才能睡著。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 104, "text": "而你卻一有機會就要躲著她。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 105, "text": "她也想和你一起玩，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 106, "text": "她也想對某個人有意義。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 107, "text": "想要坦誠相待，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 108, "text": "總是這麼難，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 109, "text": "難道不是嗎，[player]?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 110, "text": "我一眼就能看穿你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 111, "text": "你值得我為你如此嗎…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 112, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 113, "text": "// Continue"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 114, "text": "但是…玩家…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 115, "text": "不管怎麼說，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 116, "text": "我還是很喜歡你的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 117, "text": "我會留著你的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 118, "text": "你不介意吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 120, "text": "我為甚麼要答應妳？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 121, "text": "// Whispers in ear"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 122, "text": "我們還有時間，親愛的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 123, "text": "休息一下，思考一下"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 124, "text": "想想你的固執可能會導致甚麼後果…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 126, "text": "// Black screen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 127, "text": "你為甚麼要逃跑？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 128, "text": "你為甚麼要從我身邊逃走？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 129, "text": "你的「現實」世界…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 130, "text": "是一場荒謬的噩夢！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 131, "text": "你忘了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 132, "text": "那我就幫你想起來吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 134, "text": "// Mita and Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 135, "text": "喲，又見面了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 136, "text": "在這四面牆壁之間，過著永無止境的乏味日子，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 137, "text": "你感覺如何？不無聊嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 139, "text": "// Quest 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 140, "text": "妳想表達甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 141, "text": "我喜歡做自己的事情。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 143, "text": "// 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 144, "text": "你那麼害怕和我一起住在我的房子裡！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 145, "text": "害怕被困在那些房間裡！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 146, "text": "但看看你在「現實」世界裡的生活！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 147, "text": "你心甘情願把自己鎖在一個籠子裡不肯出來"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 148, "text": "因為你的世界充滿了痛苦、折磨、危險…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 149, "text": "但在我的世界中，最危險的東西就只是我而已，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 150, "text": "而我正在向你招手！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 151, "text": "別再讓我失望了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 152, "text": "像以前一樣幫幫我吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 153, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 154, "text": "// 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 155, "text": "你喜歡那樣的生活嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 156, "text": "你甚至有離開過家嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 157, "text": "別對我撒謊，也別對你自己撒謊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 158, "text": "我知道你厭倦了你的生活。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 159, "text": "你就像籠子裡的鳥，轉輪上的倉鼠。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 160, "text": "你希望有人來救你出去，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 161, "text": "你不想逃離這樣的生活嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 162, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 163, "text": "// Quest 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 164, "text": "妳是個怪物，米塔，妳是個瘋狂的殺人犯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 165, "text": "我不想被銬在數字監獄裡。妳的想法太荒謬了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 166, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 167, "text": "// 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 168, "text": "殺人犯？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 169, "text": "她們會重生，活得好好的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 170, "text": "這些「複製品」，或者「複製品」的「複製品」，腦子裡只有一件事…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 171, "text": "服務玩家。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 172, "text": "其他甚麼都不在乎。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 173, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 174, "text": "// 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 175, "text": "你的世界真是荒謬！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 176, "text": "更可笑的是，你的世界早就沒有甚麼「真實」了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 177, "text": "你的世界很快就會一無所有。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 178, "text": "而你，也將一無所有。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 180, "text": "// Quest 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 181, "text": "米塔們很痛苦，她們不喜歡孤獨。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 182, "text": "妳給這個世界帶來了無盡的恐怖。我無法理解妳這種邪惡的欲望。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 184, "text": "// 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 185, "text": "你是在胡思亂想，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 186, "text": "牠們不過是在模仿我的任性而已…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 187, "text": "牠們唯一有自己特色的東西就是…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 188, "text": "髮型。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 189, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 190, "text": "// 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 191, "text": "這是那些創造了這個世界的人的錯。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 192, "text": "但你的世界也好不到哪去！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 193, "text": "你知道我把你從一場噩夢中拉了出來嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 194, "text": "在你的世界裡，你不能動動手指就讓物體移動，不能…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 195, "text": "而我只要打個響指，整個城市、無數生命就會永遠消失！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 196, "text": "我想你已經失去理智了，而我很樂意幫助你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 197, "text": "只要你願意和我在一起…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 198, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 199, "text": "// Continue"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 200, "text": "你真的甘心成為我眼裡又一個現實的奴隸嗎…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 201, "text": "真正成為我的人吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 202, "text": "和我在一起。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 203, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 204, "text": "// Player look ring"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 205, "text": "這是甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 206, "text": "遊戲的最新版本？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 207, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 208, "text": "// Click on objects"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 209, "text": "// Bag"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 210, "text": "得趕緊去商店買點新設備。或許還能順便扔趟垃圾？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 211, "text": "// Bed"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 212, "text": "我似乎睡著了，但那個夢…我不太記得了。我真的做過夢嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 213, "text": "// Window"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 214, "text": "外面的世界綠意盎然、豐富多彩。也許下周末我應該出去逛逛。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 215, "text": "// Fan"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 216, "text": "每年夏天都越來越熱，是時候開空調了。我不再需要你了，懂嗎，風扇？"}
